# 1. Molarity Calculator

```text
START

DISPLAY "Molarity Calculator"

REPEAT FOREVER

    ASK user to enter number of moles
    STORE input as moles

    IF user wants to exit
        EXIT program
    END IF

    ASK user to enter volume of solution in mL
    STORE input as volume_ml

    IF volume_ml <= 0
        DISPLAY "Error: Volume must be greater than zero."
        CONTINUE
    END IF

    CONVERT volume from mL to liters
        volume_liters = volume_ml / 1000

    CALCULATE molarity
        molarity = moles / volume_liters

    ROUND molarity to 4 decimal places

    DISPLAY calculated molarity

    DISPLAY "Type 'exit' to quit or enter new values to calculate again"

IF invalid numerical input is entered
    DISPLAY "Error: Please enter valid numbers."

END REPEAT

END
```

