# 2. Phone Number Details

```text
START

IMPORT phone number library and required functions

DEFINE function GET_PHONE(number)

    TRY
        PARSE the phone number

        IF the phone number is invalid
            RETURN an error message
        END IF

        DETERMINE the phone number type

        IF type is MOBILE
            SET type name to "Mobile"
        ELSE IF type is FIXED_LINE
            SET type name to "Landline"
        ELSE IF type is FIXED_LINE_OR_MOBILE
            SET type name accordingly
        ELSE IF type is VOIP
            SET type name to "VoIP"
        ELSE IF type is TOLL_FREE
            SET type name to "Toll-free"
        ELSE
            SET type name to "Unknown"
        END IF

        GET location of the number
        GET carrier of the number
        GET time zones of the number

        RETURN all phone number details

    IF an error occurs
        RETURN the error message
    END TRY

END FUNCTION

CALL GET_PHONE with the given phone number

DISPLAY the returned information

END
```

