# 5. Time and Angle — Sun/Earth

```text
START

SET total degrees = 360
SET total hours = 24

CALCULATE hours corresponding to 1 degree
    hours_per_degree = total_hours / total_degrees

CONVERT hours per degree to minutes
    minutes_per_degree = hours_per_degree × 60

CALCULATE time for 5 degrees
    time_for_5_degrees = minutes_per_degree × 5

DISPLAY hours per degree
DISPLAY minutes per degree
DISPLAY time for 5 degrees

END
```

