# 6. Turtle Rainbow Flower

```text
START

IMPORT Turtle library
IMPORT Colorsys library

SET turtle drawing speed to maximum
SET background color to black

SET hue h = 0

REPEAT 16 times

    REPEAT 18 times

        CONVERT HSV color values to RGB
        SET turtle color

        INCREASE hue slightly

        TURN turtle right by 90 degrees
        DRAW a circular arc

        TURN turtle left by 90 degrees
        DRAW another circular arc

        TURN turtle by 180 degrees

    END REPEAT

    DRAW a circular arc to move to the next flower section

END REPEAT

KEEP the turtle window open

END
```

